# ESP-IDF build output for the wall panel's firmware.
#
# Not in the repository, and not ignored by accident: it is 1.5 MB that goes
# out of date at the first change under firmware/companion. The installer
# still carries it to the toolbox copy, because copy_toolbox lays the working
# tree over the clone. So a build here reaches the flash button on the page.
firmware/companion/build/
firmware/companion/sdkconfig
firmware/companion/sdkconfig.old
firmware/companion/managed_components/
